WEBVTT

00:01:30.253 --> 00:01:34.757
You know, each time I do a project,
I wonder: Can art change the world?

00:01:35.842 --> 00:01:38.344
And I never really know
how a projects starts.

00:01:38.845 --> 00:01:41.180
Couple years ago, I was making breakfast

00:01:41.222 --> 00:01:42.807
and a friend of mine called me.

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:46.394
Friend Saul, he says, "JR, you love walls.

00:01:46.394 --> 00:01:48.229
Why don't you do a project in prison?"

00:01:48.271 --> 00:01:51.941
I was like, you know, I was just,
"Dude, you know, I would do it,

00:01:51.983 --> 00:01:55.153
but it's too much paperwork
administrative, bureaucracy.

00:01:55.194 --> 00:01:58.406
Plus, I've been arrested 15 times,
they don't want me in there."

00:01:58.406 --> 00:02:00.199
And he was like, "I know, bro,